<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">1TH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">1TH - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Ayi taba, Bulus, Sila bǝn Timoti, ta tǝk zhin,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Fe aner abe akabankɔŋ nǝ nǝ Tasalɔnika ndi aye abɛ Arik Tetɛɛ, bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ki didik yi na Arik bǝn sik susun bǝ yi min.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝk nyer ndi aner Tasalɔnika ne kli mgbamgbaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Kɔte bɛr tayi ta nyɛr Arik ne atu amin bɔbɔk, te shur zhin ne ben Arik mɔr. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ba tane duŋ shu zhin zhi ne ti kɛ Arik amɔr bǝn Tetɛɛ amɔr ne ndum min kɛ duŋ zhin klɛ gbamgbaŋ, ndum min ne tsar tanyɛmɛ min, bǝn zhɔk susun min ndi ne nai anyak ne shur ayi bǝn Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Akpa amɔr, ta nǝ zhi tǝ Arik a nyɛr zhin tɛ na hria zhin tɛ bǝ yi amaa. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Tǝ tanǝ gli zhin lɛ didik kǝ men, ba nǝ lǝlɛ ankyak ba, tǝ vuŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn Izhu Tsetser, bǝn gli tanyɛmɛ yi Izhu Tsetser, ndi ne gli zhin zub. Izhin ne zhi ndi tanǝ sɔŋ ne miŋ min; nǝ yɛmɛ nǝ rɛ kǝ atu amin. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Izhin ne zǝ ki na mɔr bǝn yi Ŋgɔŋ; ne min kɛ yik iya, izhin ne ta lɛ didik ne nyɛr ikɛ nǝk Izhu Tsetser. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ne me izhin ne yi ki ndi abǝ zǝ Kristi atei zǝ nkɔŋ min ne ntun yi Makidɔniya bǝn Akaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Ilɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne yir bǝn abɛ zhin te shak ankpa bane Makidɔniya bǝn Akaya ankyak ba itanyɛmɛ min ne lɛ kɛ Arik ne zǝ kɔte me. Ndi iye me, ba sɛ tanǝ na di kinuŋ ne tu mɔ ba. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Bɔbɔk anɛr alɛ nɛ atu min irkǝŋ ndi izhin nǝ ta ta nǝ nye mɔr, bǝn iyiŋ ndi izhin nǝ ŋur kam nyak bǝn Arik, tǝ duŋ zǝ anerim te zǝ Arik nǝ zub nǝ vli <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />te zhin bǝ ŋub Izu maa nǝ rɛ gbarshu, waŋ ndi ne lɛgu ne ku, ayi Yesɔ, waŋ ndi ne ta ta zhɔk ne mfu kɛ nyɛ.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne na ndum kɛ Arik ne ntun yi Tasalɔnika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Akpa amɔr, izhin nǝ zhi tǝ nyɛ mɔr bǝn abɛzhin banǝ yi sha ba. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ta ne ka yik iya te ne pwar ta aŋyak ne ntun yi Filibi, ndi izhin ne zhi, fe ne ŋɔk kɛ Arik tane bla zhin lɛ didik kǝ men maa ne miŋ kɛ abɛ kyak ta. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Tǝ lɛ didik kǝ bla mɔrɔ banǝ zhik nǝ atu ayi dur ba, ko kai ŋaa anu yi rik ba, kɔ ka ta na tǝ tabǝ kpur zhin ba. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Nǝ gar nuŋ, ta lɛ kɔtǝ mkpaŋ takǝ ndi Arik adi ta, tǝ nɛ yikta nǝ mla tǝ abɛ nǝkta lɛ didik kǝ men. Ba ta na iyik ayi bǝn aneshir ba, ama ta naa Arik, iwaŋ ndi atsar idur amɔr. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Izhin ne zhi ba ta ne lɔm zhin ne lɛ kɛ men anu ba, kɔ ka tane su abu ane tik yi ba, Arik wa ayi nǝ yaa amɔrɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ba ta wɔb te bɛ gbar ta nǝe ti kǝ nuŋ ba, kɔ bǝn izhineba kɔ bǝn anuŋ ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Ndi abɛ na ndum Kristi tei bǝ yi ihru bǝn abɛ zhin, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />kɔ nɛmɛ ndi tayi abǝ na ndum kǝ Kristi tai bǝ wɔb kinuŋ bǝnɛ bɛzhin. Ama ta nǝ yi zǝǝ ndi tanǝ ri yi bǝn abɛzhin, ndi iya ayɔk amumun amaa. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ndi nyɛr mɔr yi nɛ atu amin tanǝ tanyɛmɛ tǝ ta bǝ duu lɛ didik kǝ men ikɛ Arik ndɔ ama tǝ vuŋ asusun amɔr. Izhin yii ta nɛ susun! <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Nǝ shu zhi min, akpa amɔr, ir kǝŋ ndi tanǝ na ndum! Tanǝ na ndum aririk bǝn ibu tǝ kǝr tabǝ yii zhin hru nǝ zǝn du lɛ didik kǝ men kɛ Arik ba.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Izhin ne yik ne ayi amin, ben Arik maa yi, ndi tsetser, anenen bǝn yaŋ lalɛ ta ne yime ne miŋ kɛ abɛ ta nyɛmɛ ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Tǝ zhin ne zhi te ta te bǝn kɔte ŋɔ ne miŋ mine ndi atǝtɛɛ ana bǝn amumun amen. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Ta nǝk zhin lɛ, tena nǝk zhin anu akǝ sɔŋ kǝ sǝk susun, tǝna di izhin bǝ sɔŋsɔŋ yi nkɔŋ kɛ Arik, waŋ ndi azhɔ zhin tǝ bǝ yik sɔŋ nǝ kɔb ngɔŋ maa bǝn ngɔŋ.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Fena ikinuŋ na yimɛ ndi ta na nyɛr Arik iyaŋ sɔŋ sik. Ndi tanǝ glii zhin lɛ kɛ Arik, izhin nǝ wɔ kǝ tǝna takǝ, ayi lɛmɛ kǝ, bazhin nǝ takǝ ndi lɛ kɛ bla aneshir ba ama ndi kɛ Arik, ayi lɛmɛ kǝ. Tǝ Arik azǝn na ndum maa nɛ atu amin abǝ tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Akpa amɔr, ai kiki ir zhiin yi nǝna vuŋ zhin ndi nǝ vuŋ abǝ zǝ Arik nɛ Akabakɔŋ ayi Yahudiya, bǝn aneshir abaŋ ndi ayi abǝ Kristi Yesɔ. Izhin nǝ yik ir iya zhiin bǝn aneshir amin tǝ aba nɛ yik iya nɛ aŋɔk anǝ Yahudawa, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Yahudawa ne ŋun Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ bǝn abɛ bla shar Arik tena yar ta rumɔ. Arik bane wɔ men mǝne ba te ne sak aneshir iya <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />ne su tu men te aba bɛ yar ta blaa abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba ilɛ kɛ Arik te bɛ ta ba zhɔk. Ndi amɛ, azǝn duŋ lalɛ mǝne ilu tetɛk iyaŋ klɛ. Mfu kɛ Arik ne nyɛ ne atu mǝne.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus nɛ tǝ te wa abɛ te yik aner abɛ zi Arik nǝ Tasalɔnika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ate yi taba, akpǝkpa, ndi nɛ gli ta tibɛ bǝne bɛzhin nǝ vǝ mkpaŋ wɔtsɔb banǝ lɛ kǝ idur mɔr ba, nǝ yɛmɛ, ama nǝ kpa ankyak ir kǝŋ ndi tanǝ yaŋ yik zhin tǝna tsǝ kli tǝ tabǝ na yik zhin! <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Tǝ tane di ta tei nyɛ yik zhin, Nga, Bulus, mne ntsǝ nkli tena ntsǝ nkli, ama ine shetan ne yar tama. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Tǝ aye nii iyi izhɔk susun mɔrɔ, inyɛr mɔrɔ, kai su tu angu keŋ ndi itei nǝk ta ŋgɔŋ ne ti kɛ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ ndi ate nyɛi? Bai izhineba ba kai? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Iyeme, ai izhineba ba yi iki yi ŋur asa mɔr bǝn nyɛr mɔr.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Fe ndi tane vuŋ asusun lak kana ne yaŋ yik amunya, ta ku yik ne rɛ te tabǝ kɔmɔ ne Antina. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Nga Bulus bǝn Sila, ta ku shar Timoti, waŋ ndi ayi zumɔr te ana yi kpa ne na ndum lɛ didik kɛ Kristi, abɛ te nǝk zhin lɛ tena di izhin bǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ne lɛ kɛ Arik, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />te duŋ kǝr nuŋ abɛ yaŋ zhɔk kpa ne miŋ kɛ zǝn yik iya mɔr ba. Izhin ne zhi min yi te Arik ne zhi te ta tei yik kiki yiŋɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Ilɛ didik, ndi tane yi ben abɛ zhin, tane zǝn bla zhin te atei sak ta iya. Fena ne kam yeme, ndi izhin ne zhi ngɔŋ. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Fe ne yeme, ndi bam nena mvuŋ susun yir ba, mne shar te bɛ te wɔ kli kɛ tanyɛmɛ min ne nkɔŋ kɛ Arik. Mne nklu sǝsǝk te kǝr nǝ ten ta ma abɛ ana zǝ ankɔŋ azhin awaŋa te lɔm zhin te duŋ ndum mɔrɔ bǝ yi sha.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti ne bla ilɛ kɛ men</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ankyak Timoti are bǝn zhin te asɔŋɔ yir bǝn abɛta azizaŋa te blaa ta lɛ didik netu ayi kli mgbamgbaŋ bǝn tanyɛmɛ min. Timoti ne bla ta tedi izhin shu zhi ki didik ne atu amɔr bǝn iyiŋ ndi izhin zǝn shur ayi te izhin bǝ yik nyɛ mɔr, ndi itaba mɔr yi shur ayi tǝ ta bǝ yik zhin. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Fena, akpa, ne dǝk mɔr bǝn yik iya mɔr ikpa mɔr ne ŋur klik ndi tane wɔ kli mgbamgbaŋ min ne ta nyɛmɛ ne ilɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Fe azizaŋa tayi atsitsir, te tane yik ikli min mgbamgbaŋ ne lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ai nyɛr tayi ta tei bla Arik neyi iyi mla netu amin ndi izhin ne kam gli nyɛr mɔr nyaga ne ti kɛ Arik ne atu amini? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Ibu bǝn aririk ta ben Arik iyaŋ sɔŋ sik te tabǝ kana yik zhin ayi bǝn ayi tǝ ka nǝk zhin kiki yiŋ ndi izhin yaŋa neyi ne ta lɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Azizaŋa ta ben tǝ Arik Ŋgɔŋ ndi ana yi Tetɛɛ bǝn Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ ne bu ta ankɔŋ ane nyɛ ben abɛ zhin. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Ta ben tǝ Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ abɛ duŋ tanyɛmɛ ne akpa min bǝ yi ŋgɔŋ tena shak var hrie netu ayi kɔte ner tawa, ndi imɔr neyi ne atu amin. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Ta ben tǝ Arik abɛ duŋ asusun amin abɛ klik ndi ba nuŋ atei yik zhin abɛ lalɛ tena duŋ asusun amin abɛ yi tsetser nǝ ti kɛ Arik bǝn Tetɛɛ ndi Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr ate nyɛ bǝn aner tsetser abǝ zǝu.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Itsin keŋ ndi Arik a nyɛr kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ne klɛtu, akpa amɔr, ta ben zhin, tena gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ te sɔŋ min bǝ duŋ Arik a nyɛr zhin, ir keŋ ndi izhin tsin azǝzaŋa ta rib zhin te ben zhin ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ izhin bǝ tsǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Te zhin ne zhi te gbaŋ atɔŋ iyiŋ ndi tane bla zhin ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Arik awɔb tǝ zhin bǝ yi tsetser tǝna tǝ shaan nǝ bubu yi kur bǝn iwa waŋ ndi ba yi wami ba. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />kɔte ŋɔ nǝ miŋ min abɛ vuŋ kpa maa agli mgbamgbaŋ ne nkɔŋ kɛ tsetser bǝn nǝk ngɔŋ, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />bane tik ayi ndi abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik ba, ndi ba ne zhi Arik ba; <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />ne min kɛ lɛ kǝŋe, fɛ, kǝr nuŋ abɛ laa nuŋ lɛ kai abǝ zǝ Kristi yik ankɔŋ vuŋ ku ayi.Tanǝka gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ nǝ yiŋe, fe ta tara gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ tǝ Ŋgɔŋ atei sak abaŋ ndi ana mɛ iya. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Amɛ Arik bane zhɔ ta te ta bǝ na ki mimin ba, ne zhɔ ta te ta bǝ tsǝn tsetser. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Amɛ waŋ ndi te kyak zǝ lɛ kǝŋe bane kyak ineshir ba ne kyak Arik, Arik waŋ ndi ne nǝgu Izhu Tsetser maa.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ba sɛ tanǝ na cɛr zhin nɛ atu ayi nyɛr yɛ kpa ba.Izhineba nǝ tu min Arik ane tsar zhin ir kǝŋ ndi izhin bǝ nyɛr akpa. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Fe izhin gli, ayi lɛ didik, izhin bǝ tsǝn bɔbɔk amɛ bǝn abǝ zǝ Kristi bɔbɔk ne Makidɔniya. Ndi iyɛmɛ ta bɛn zhin, akpa amɔr ben amunvamɔr, izhin bɛ tanyɛmɛ ne akpamin ngɔŋ.<verse eid="1TH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Izhin bɛ nek atu amin te sɔŋ zhin keke ne akpamin, kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ tɔ ki yiŋ ndi iyi ne ti maa te na ndum ne ŋɔk amaa ir keŋ ndi tane bla zhin, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />te izhin bǝ vuŋ asusun abaŋ ndi ba yi abǝ zǝ Kristi ba, kǝr zhin bɛ shur nuŋ ayi ba.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Akpa amɔr, ta wɔb tǝ zhin bǝ zhi zub nɛ atu yɛ abaŋ ndi nɛka ku, tǝ kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ asusun amin acok ala ba, ndi abǝ yaŋ zhɔk susun ba. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ta tanyɛmɛ tǝ Yesɔ nɛ ku tɛ na lu, fena tanǝ tanyɛmɛ tǝ Arik atei baŋ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tɛ kɔmɔ ndi ne ka ku nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝne bɔu. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ir keŋ ndi ilɛ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne bla, ta bla zhin te di taba baŋ ndi ta nak rei atsitsir, ndi ta tei yik nyɛ Yesɔ, bata tei kuti lu te duŋ abaŋ ndi ne ku ba. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Atei wɔ nǝ kɔr ngɔŋ, ikɔr kǝ inǝ shar ayou Arik, iglɔ yi mpluŋ kɛ Arik, bǝn Ŋgɔŋ nǝ tu maa atei zi are gbarshu. Abaŋ ndi neka kaku nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Kristi atei kuti alu; <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />fe ta baŋ ndi ta yi atsitsir nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ atei tuŋta biŋ nɛ akpa tǝ tabǝ yik Ŋgɔŋ nǝ shu. Ankyak ta tei sɔŋ kɔtǝ mkpaŋ takǝ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Fena, nǝkzhin akpa sik susun nǝ nkan lǝlɛ yiŋe.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Bai kinuŋ yi na cɛr zhin ba, akpa, nɛ atu yi mkpaŋ bǝn ibɛr ndi kiki yiŋɛ tei na. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />te zhin ne zhi bɔbɔk tedi iber yi nyɛ Yesɔ itei yi ndi ne zhib ne bu. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi aneshir adi aba sɔŋ &lt;&lt;keke ben sɔŋ kɛ sik,&gt;&gt; atei kam aneshir aku, ir keŋ ndi iwa azhin nnɛ kɛ ŋli, batei li aru ba.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Fɛ izhineba, akpǝkpa, ba zhin kusɔŋ nǝ bu ba, tǝ Bɛrɛ bǝ klazhin vu nǝ yaŋ zhi ndi nǝ zhib. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Bɔbɔk mine izhin yi aneshir abɛ laŋ amkpa aririk, ba ta yi abɛ bu ba. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ne me, kǝr ta bɛ yi ndi abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik ba, abaŋ ndi asɔŋ awa, ta bɛ sɔŋ shur ayi ne shur kpa. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Tǝ abaŋ ndi Akurna akurǝ ne bu, abaŋ ndi ahwa, asɔ ne bu te hwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Fe taba baŋ ndi ta yi abɛ aririk, ta bǝ tanyɛmɛ ne asusun amɔr tena nyɛr ne akpa tena duŋ ta ta shur bɛ yi ta adaŋgbaŋ, ane ku kpa ane tyak ikum te na zhɔk asusun kɛ ta zhɔk ndi akatak. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Te Arik bane hria ta te ta bǝ yik iyah ne bɛr yi nyɛ maa ba ama abɛ ta ta shur ne bɛr yi nyɛ maa ire bǝn Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Yesɔ ne ku ne atu amɔr, te ta bǝ sɔŋ bǝn abɔu kɔ tabǝ yi atsitsir kɔ ne miŋ kɛ ku, ta tei sɔŋ bǝn abɔu. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ne me, bla zhin akpa te na lɔk zhin akpa te kli mgbamgbaŋ, ir keŋ ndi izhin nama.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nek kenlɛ yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Fe ta ben zhin abɛ zǝ Yesɔ, abaŋ ndi ana ndum kɛ Arik nek zhin ba ŋgɔŋ men, abaŋ ndi abla zhin lɛ kɛ Arik ndi aba yi angɔŋgɔŋ amin. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Izhin bǝ gli ba gligli didik ne ndum keŋ ndi ana kɛ. Izhin bǝ sɔŋ keke ne akpa min. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Tei na nek zhin lɛ, izhineba amunzumɔr bǝn amunvamɔr, izhin bǝ vǝ abaŋ ndi ate ankɔ, izhin bena lɔk abaŋ ndi ba klik ba, izhin bǝ na vuŋ asusun bǝn kɔte ŋɔwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Izhin bǝ te zee kǝr nuŋ bɛ na nuŋ ki mimin ir keŋ ndi ne nau ba. Izhin bǝ na akpa kiki didik ben aneshir bɔbɔk.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Izhin bǝ nyɛr kɔte mkpaŋ ta kɛ; <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Izhin bǝ ben Arik kɔte mkpaŋ ta kɛ; <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Izhin bɛ nyɛr Arik ne kɔte anii te waŋa ayi na Arik bǝn abɛ zhin ne sak kɛ Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Kǝr zhin bǝ kyak lɛ kɛ Izhu tsetser ba; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />kǝr zhin bǝ yaŋ tɔ lɛ kɛ Arik yaŋ shak ayi ba. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Izhin bɛ tsar kɔte anii. Izhin bɛ gli iki yiŋ ndi iyi didik. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Duŋ tɔ zhin kɔte ki tayi ndi iyi mimin ba.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ta ben Arik wa ne tu maa, Arik ne nǝk sɔŋ kɛ sik susun, te izhu min bɔbɔk,asusun amin ben akpa amin bɛ yi tsetser kɔte mkpaŋ a kɛ nyɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Arik waŋ ndi ne zhɔ zhin ayi ne na ki didik, atei na zhin ne yi.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Amunzumɔr bǝn amunvamɔr, izhin bǝ bǝn ta Arik. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Izhin bǝ tek ta aneshir abɛ zǝ Arik bɔbɔk ne ku asa tsetser. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Nga Bulus mne baŋ zhin sak ne aŋɔk ayi Ŋgɔŋ te izhin bǝ tɔ cɛr iyiŋɛ bɔbɔk min abɛ zǝ Arik.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Didik kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi bǝ sɔŋ bǝn abɛ zhin.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>